<title>LATVIA: BANKA LAND 1996 PROFIT 229,000 LATS.</title>
<headline>BANKA LAND 1996 PROFIT 229,000 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banka LAND said that its 1996 profit was 229,000 lats, which will all be put into increasing the bank's share capital, the bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The bank also said that its shareholder meeting today will discuss converting the fifth issue of shares and the bank's 1996 activities.</p>
<p>The bank's paid up caital at the end of 1996 was 1.34 million lats, 379,000 lats higher than at the end of 1995.</p>
<p>Own capital is confirmed at 1.63 million lats, the bank added.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
